WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.100
Narrator: Every time you communicate, you are either the sender or the receiver.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:10.300
Narrator: The sender decides what to say, puts it into words and sends it.

3
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.700
Narrator: The receiver takes it in, understands it and replies if needed.

4
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:22.700
Narrator: If the message isn't understood, it hasn't been communicated - however loudly you said it.

5
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:31.800
Narrator: On the radio, 'Over' hands the turn to the receiver, and 'Copy that' tells you your message got through.

